{"id": "1530031943956303873", "channel_id": "1510911214346305566", "author_id": "1425265631078645841", "author_name": "megane0965_78083", "content": "幻夢ジェンキン\n16ターン\n\nリリーピックアップ、ライカー使えるので非常に助かります。\n\n沙耶と上堕ち札の侵食が流石に強かった（上堕ちの交換可能時期や沙耶熱が高い時期に上方修正すれば良かったのに…）\nボス戦で3,000近く侵食もれたので、そこそこのダメージ源に", "timestamp": "2026-07-24T02:00:42.058000+00:00", "thread_id": "1510911214346305566", "edited_timestamp": "2026-07-24T02:00:55.746000+00:00", "attachments": [{"id": "1530031943444332705", "filename": "IMG_9024.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 1054291, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1510911214346305566/1530031943444332705/IMG_9024.png?ex=6a6418c9&is=6a62c749&hm=655399bd192773728bee0bd31943d90dbc67ef027f5d40dfa35dcb3e39d1510e&"}, {"id": "1530031943842926712", "filename": "IMG_9023.png", "content_type": "image/png", "size": 590567, "url": "https://cdn.discordapp.com/attachments/1510911214346305566/1530031943842926712/IMG_9023.png?ex=6a6418ca&is=6a62c74a&hm=77d6575f84d379ced03ff6343580e25ffdf122bca277b28cd0a1248b39345994&"}]}
